[2959164.1] GL ECC Data Load Program Error job failed with error code:Invalid state and after this, data load for a dataset is empty.</li></ul> ',
      p_success_msg            => 'The "General Ledger Command Center Data Load" and its "ECC Run Data Load" concurrent program, submitted in the Last seven Days, were completed successfully.',
